sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Maintainer
    participant Ctrl as MaintenanceController
    participant Service as MaintenanceService
    participant DB as Database

    note right of Client: GET /maintenance/my-issues
    Client->>Ctrl: GET request
    activate Ctrl

    Ctrl->>Service: listMyIssues(accountId)
    activate Service

    Service->>DB: Get staff info & assignments (with issue + room)
    DB-->>Service: StaffInfo + IssueAssignment[]

    alt Staff not found
        Service-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    end

    Service-->>Ctrl: IssueAssignment[]
    deactivate Service

    Ctrl-->>Client: 200 OK
    deactivate Ctrl
